        "id": "EX-GRAM-G-hsk3-negative-evaluation-teach",
        "kind": "teach",
        "title": "Give a mild negative evaluation",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "不怎么样 is a conventional way to say not very good. Here 怎么样 is part of the negative evaluation, not a request for an explanation of how something is done.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "这家饭店的菜不怎么样，我们以后去别的饭店吃饭吧。",
                "pinyin": "zhè jiā fàndiàn de cài bù zěnmeyàng ， wǒmen yǐhòu qù biéde fàndiàn chī fàn ba 。",
                "meaning": "The food at this restaurant is not very good. Let us eat at another restaurant in future.",
                "audio": "038722cea1022aba1fd8384347ce1a0c1503dd0970ca9becc4a353445d5cd72f"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
